{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55264","headline":"南游有怀 · 龚霖","name":"南游有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怀才非独步，驱马出荆州。\n亲老未归去，路长何处游？\n鸟啼云梦晓，叶落洞庭秋。\n襟抱谁相问？西风吹客愁。\n（同前书第二六九页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"龚霖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}